    "chunk_text": "Nor\u00f0hymbra preosta lagu. Gyf hwa \u00e6nigum preoste \u00e6nig woh beode, beon ealle geferan mid biscopes filste georne ymbe \u00fea bote & And Godes forboda we forbeoda\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig preost o\u00f0re cirican na\u00f0er ne gebicg\u00e6 ne ge\u00feicg\u00e6, buton & gif hit \u00e6nig preost elles gedo, \u00feolige his wur\u00f0scipes & geferena freondscipes & he nahwar ne & gilde se \u00fee woh dide XX or \u00feam biscope, XII or \u00feam preoste, \u00fee he of his circan asette, XII or & \u00e6lc preost finde him XII festermen, \u00fe\u00e6t he preostlage wille healdan mid rihte. And gif hwilc preost agilte & he ofer biscopes gebod m\u00e6ssige, gilde for \u00f0am gebode XX or, & \u00fear to Gif preost biscopes agen geban forbuge, gilde XX or. Gif preost dom to l\u00e6wedum sceote, \u00fee he to gehadedum scolde, gilde XX or. Gif preost arcediacones geban forbuge, gilde XII or. Gif preost scildig sy & he ofer arcediacones gebod m\u00e6ssige, gilde XII or. Gif preost fulluhtes o\u00f0\u00f0e scriftes forwyrne, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t mid XII or & huru wi\u00f0 God \u00feingige georne. Gif preost to rihtes timan crisman ne fecce, gilde XII or. \u00c6ghwilc cild sy, we l\u00e6ra\u00f0, gefullod binnon nigon nihton, be wite VI or. & gif h\u00e6\u00feen cild binnon IX nihton \u00feurh gimeliste forfaren sy, betan for Gode buton worldwite; & gif Gif preost folce miswissige \u00e6t freolse o\u00f0\u00f0e f\u00e6stene, bete wi\u00f0 God & g",
